{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40a84e02825d034610deb52c0330a1cd67b00ec0f2a1829b2c7f2f6e15372c32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1eca04f423e5e623d297b51921bd04709840ed97644153758898fbdba5c1346",
      "text": "我自认为一直以来都在为学生着想，\n为他们的教育倾注了全部心血。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:141207be3f7aa160fee34a8f5e656dce42509eeee5aa8b241c15fef6be0ba677",
      "text": "为了让他们对学业产生兴趣，\n想尽了各种各样的办法。……但是，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:938bf30d3a09fcf0b587d83e262ff2b378441c50283b5961ded221c440d9df2a",
      "text": "我所推行的“讲大道理的办法”，\n是行不通的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c8e7c17fac77a5f09aae9964dfffe41c5fca5bf2926f30a3f699ef70b807e92",
      "text": "必须要有贴合学生们的方法才行……\n那就是，偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bb651916c7fc483e91ce5cc332e1a87b955400ab6afb4227231147c5c11b034",
      "text": "……原来如此啊。我明白你为什么突然说要\n去当偶像了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62b7172e9402f9b146922f67fb62eddfc406d3f264ba5470927eae20d7b9e819",
      "text": "（这个人真是，看起来冷冰冰的，内心其实火热得很呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e7fc7158448c1b7e28d187ca6a3366c309bb267a68437653aa28dc191da603c",
      "text": "想必山下君也看到了吧。\n学生们那充满光彩的表情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c19d65f25cbbad12b25383bfef12cf6c393e01c9404fff03c7ccc3038082ea58",
      "text": "至今为止，我一次也没能让学生们\n露出那样的表情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:090ad8c1f5428c8d054e394adbf0875967962b10852b8528c1698490c97bc337",
      "text": "但如果我也成为偶像，\n这次一定能够引导学生们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25115a8543aee2d096a49a05d57b38519d3394967b37f79e6ea98b390f8aba29",
      "text": "我要成为偶像！……然后，\n一定要让学生们萌生出对学业的热情！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
